  "summary": "-  Strong hands-on experience in leading and implementing Alfresco based ECM solutions, Java, J2EE, Object-oriented Architecture &amp; Web-based front-end development\n-  Strong leadership, inter-personnel and management skills to execute projects from concept level to actual development.\n-  Strong experience in undertaking scalable solutions in Alfresco Web Content Management, Document Management &amp; Alfresco RESTful Webscripts.\n-  Expertise in implementing J2EE technologies (JSP, Servlets, JSF, ICEFaces, MVC Frameworks) to develop Enterprise web applications.\n-  Extensive development experience on Application Servers such as Jakarta Tomcat and Apache web server. Experience in server-side configuration, administration, application deployments.\n-  Experience in GUI development using JSF, ICeFaces, JSP, JSTL, JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and Flash.\n- Proficient in SQL, RDBMS (Oracle, MySQL, Postgres, Derby, HSQL). Very comfortable in writing and understanding complex queries.\n-  Knowledge of Portal Environments like Liferay Portal.\n-  Experience in full Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC) - Requirements Analysis, Design, Development, Testing, Deployment, Documentation.\n-  Very comfortable working with individual or team settings to contribute to projects of different size\n-  A dedicated team player with outstanding technical knowledge, organizational, interpersonal, analytical, and problem solving skills.\n\nSpecialties: Java/J2EE, Spring, Hibernate, XML,Alfresco, Document Management, Web Content Management",
